.TH LIBTIMED 3 "" "0.1.10" "Peios Library Functions"
.SH NAME
libtimed \- timed client and configuration API
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <peios/timed.h>
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The library exposes ABI 1 through libtimed.so.1.
The installed header defines the complete API, result views, and ownership rules.
Inputs are borrowed for a call. Results own their views until freed.
Copy views before releasing their result.
Mutable subscription handles require exclusive access.
.SH ERRORS
Result errors are POSIX error numbers. Diagnostic text is intended for people.
A positive timeout in milliseconds covers connection, sending, and receiving.
Operations are not replayed after uncertain I/O failures.
.SH LINKING
Use pkg-config with the timed module.
The safe Rust wrapper is the timed-client crate.
.SH SEE ALSO
clock(1), timed(8)
